,"html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>99</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>110</span></div>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"definition-and-signature-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_T,\\leq_T\">\\(D_T,\\leq_T\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f5b9611e728efd8b\" href=\"?note=f5b9611e728efd8b\" title=\"67-df-degree-structure\">67-df-degree-structure</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\subseteq D_T\">\\(G\\subseteq D_T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in D_T\">\\(c\\in D_T\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sup}_T(G,c)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sup}_T(G,c)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Inf}_T(G,c)\">\\(\\mathrm{Inf}_T(G,c)\\)</span> 是下式定义的二元谓词。量化 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 时论域为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(D_T)\">\\(\\mathcal P(D_T)\\)</span>，允许 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=\\varnothing\">\\(G=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sup}_T(G,c)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\left((\\forall a\\in G\\;a\\leq_Tc)\\land\\forall d\\in D_T\\;((\\forall a\\in G\\;a\\leq_Td)\\to c\\leq_Td)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Sup}_T(G,c)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\left((\\forall a\\in G\\;a\\leq_Tc)\\land\\forall d\\in D_T\\;((\\forall a\\in G\\;a\\leq_Td)\\to c\\leq_Td)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Inf}_T(G,c)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\left((\\forall a\\in G\\;c\\leq_Ta)\\land\\forall d\\in D_T\\;((\\forall a\\in G\\;d\\leq_Ta)\\to d\\leq_Tc)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Inf}_T(G,c)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\left((\\forall a\\in G\\;c\\leq_Ta)\\land\\forall d\\in D_T\\;((\\forall a\\in G\\;d\\leq_Ta)\\to d\\leq_Tc)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应原书印刷99页/PDF110页的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigcup G\">\\(\\bigcup G\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigcap G\">\\(\\bigcap G\\)</span>（分别为存在时的最小上界、最大下界）。用关系式避免把本来可能不存在的界写成全函数。反对称性保证每个谓词的第二参数至多一个；存在性必须另行证明。尤其解释度格的有限交并存在，不意味着任意子集都有界。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-degree-structure","status":"resolved","id":"f5b9611e728efd8b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-degree-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-degree-structure","status":"resolved","id":"f5b9611e728efd8b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$D_T,\\leq_T$ 采用 [[67-df-degree-structure]]；$G\\subseteq D_T$，$c\\in D_T$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"D_T,\\leq_T","display":false},{"tex":"G\\subseteq D_T","display":false},{"tex":"c\\in D_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sup}_T(G,c)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Inf}_T(G,c)","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(D_T)","display":false},{"tex":"G=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sup}_T(G,c)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\left((\\forall a\\in G\\;a\\leq_Tc)\\land\\forall d\\in D_T\\;((\\forall a\\in G\\;a\\leq_Td)\\to c\\leq_Td)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Inf}_T(G,c)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\left((\\forall a\\in G\\;c\\leq_Ta)\\la